      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"professional\" thing feels so useless lol. like i've talked to people. it doesnt change the fact that every morning i wake up and it's just more of the same. more bills, more failing at my job, more people being disappointed in me. it's like a loop i can't escape. i'm just so done with the struggle of it all. does it ever actually get better or is this just what life is now?",
